   <taskbody>  <context>
    <p>New records can be created in three ways:</p><ul>
         <li>When a user adds a new data row using the <b>Add Row</b> menu button.</li>
         <li>When the App automatically adds a new data row using the <b>Add row Action</b> and pastes data into the new row.</li>
         <li>Using a <b>Preloaded Grid</b> (see <xref href="#workingwithsavemapspreloadedgrid">Creating Preloaded Grids</xref>).</li>
      </ul>
  </context></taskbody>
